@startuml
[*] --> PowerOn : Hardware Reset
PowerOn --> UEFI_Firmware : POST Initialization
UEFI_Firmware --> BootLoader : Hand off to GRUB / systemd-boot
BootLoader --> LinuxKernel : Load vmlinuz & initramfs
LinuxKernel --> InitrdStage : Mount volatile root fs & cryptsetup
InitrdStage --> SystemdPID1 : Switch root (/sbin/init)

state SystemdPID1 {
  [*] --> sysinit_target : Start udevd & journald
  sysinit_target --> basic_target : Sockets & Timers active
  basic_target --> network_target : Network stack initialization
  network_target --> multi_user_target : Background system daemons
  multi_user_target --> graphical_target : Display Manager (GDM/SDDM)
}

graphical_target --> DesktopReady : Boot Complete
DesktopReady --> [*]
@enduml
